@startuml

salt
{
  <b>MARKET DATA</b> | Bindings | History | [ Bind a source ]
  --
  Bindings 12 | Enabled 11 | Running 10 | Quiet 1
  --
  Kind | ^All^ | State | ^All^ | [ Search source ]
  --
  {#
    Source | Kind | Feeds series | Enabled | Running | Last tick
    synthetic.bloomberg.audusd | Synthetic | AUD/USD spot rate | [X] | Running | 2 s ago
    synthetic.bloomberg.eurestr | Synthetic | EUR overnight curve | [X] | Running | 2 s ago
    synthetic.bloomberg.copibr | Synthetic | USD/COP spot rate | [X] | <b>Quiet</b> | 1 h ago
    synthetic.bloomberg.nzdusd | Synthetic | NZD/USD spot rate | [ ] | Stopped | 3 d ago
    vendor.example.eurusd | Vendor | EUR/USD spot rate | [X] | Not supported | -
  }
  --
  <b>Selected: synthetic.bloomberg.copibr</b> | Details | History
  {
    Producer | FX spot generation config, 1800 ticks an hour, bound, auto-start
    Series | USD/COP spot rate (inferred from observations)
    | [ Rebind ] | [ Disable ] | [ Start ] | [ Stop ] | [ Remove ]
  }
  --
  History tab: v3 enabled by market data operator | v2 disabled | v1 created by tenant provisioning
  ..
  <i>A vendor binding: real feeds are not supported. Rebind and Start are not offered.</i>
  ..
  {+
    <b>Bind a source</b>
    Source | ^synthetic.bloomberg.gbpusd^
    Would write | GBP/USD spot rate
    Held by | no other running feed
    Reason | ^Amend^
    [ Cancel ] | [ Bind ]
  }
}

@enduml
